		(property "Description" "4 Digit 7 Segment Display\n\nThis is a part for the 4-Digit 7-segment LEDs from Young Sun.  Different from the Digikey LEDs, all 16 pins are used.\nThe LONGPADS Variant is used for a test jig, but you may like it because there is more pad to solder to. If you are concerned about routing space, the standard works just fine though.\n\nDatasheets:\n\n• http://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/7-Segment/YSD-439AR6B-35.pdf Red\n• http://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/7-Segment/YSD-439AY2B-35.pdf Yellow\n• http://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/7-Segment/YSD-439AK2B-35.pdf Kelly Green\n• http://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/7-Segment/YSD-439AB4B-35.pdf Blue\n• http://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/ATA3492BW_2.pdf White\n\nSparkFun Products\nRaw Components\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9483 7-Segment Display - 4-Digit (Red) (COM-09483)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9480 7-Segment Display - 4-Digit (Yellow) (COM-09480)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9482 7-Segment Display - 4-Digit (Kelly Green) (COM-09482)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9481 7-Segment Display - 4-Digit (Blue) (COM-09481)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10931 7-Segment Display - 4-Digit (White) ( COM-10931) Serial Controlled\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11441 SparkFun 7-Segment Serial Display - Red (COM-11441)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11443 SparkFun 7-Segment Serial Display - Yellow (COM-11443)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11440 SparkFun 7-Segment Serial Display - Kelly Green (COM-11440)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11442 SparkFun 7-Segment Serial Display - Blue (COM-11442)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11629 SparkFun 7-Segment Serial Display - White (COM-11629) Other\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11734 SparkFun BigTime Watch Kit (KIT-11734)"
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
