		(property "Description" "MCP794xx - Battery Backed I2C Real Time Clock (RTC) with SRAM (EEPROM*) and Protected EERPOM\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n• VCC: 1.8~5.5V\n• VBat: 1.3~5.5V\n• IQ: 1.2&mu;A @ 3.3V Vcc, 925nA @ 3.0V VBat\n• Memory: 64B, 64B Protected EEPROM, 1kB EEPROM*\n• Interface: I2C\n• Operating Temperature: -40°C to 85°C\n\n*Only on MCP7941x models\n\nDigikey:\nMCP79411, SOIC (MCP79411T-I/SNCT-ND)   MCP79412, SOIC (MCP79412-I/SN-ND)   Pin Compatible Alternatives     Note: These are recomendations at the time, always verify pin compatability using combination of Mrk1 EyeBall and quality datasheet"
