		(property "Description" "PCA9536 - I2C I/O Expander, 4 bit, 5V tollerant\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n• Vcc: 2.3V ~ 5.5V\n•  IOut: >10mA\n• IQ: 1&mu;A\n• Operating Temperature: -40°C to 85°C\n• Internal Pullups\n\nDigikey:\n\n296-20952-1-ND (DGK)    568-4079-1-ND (SON)\n\n*Datasheet for PCA9536TK does not explicitly specify connection of exposed pad, but using information from NXP engineering bulletin EB806 for justification for connecting EP to GND. See page 4 \"Freescale [NXP] recommends electrically connecting the exposed pad of QFN and DFN devices to MCU ground...\""
